These are my comments to Keith's piece--by the way, it was posted
in sci.life-extension and sci.cryonics. 

***********************************************************************

In article <389uk6$fn3@access2.digex.net>,
Keith F. Lynch <kfl@access.digex.net> wrote:
>
>I'm assuming that a person's personality, memories, aspirations, and
